# Cloudflare Pages already serves clean URLs: /privacy.html is reachable at
# /privacy, and Pages 308s the .html form to the clean one automatically.
#
# DO NOT add `/privacy /privacy.html 200` style rewrites. That was here and it
# caused an INFINITE REDIRECT LOOP: the rewrite pointed at /privacy.html,
# Pages redirected that back to /privacy, and round it went. The page 308'd to
# itself forever. Clean URLs need no rule at all.

# og.html is the SOURCE for the social card, not a page anyone should land on.
/og        /   301
/og.html   /   301
